Bharata crosses Shatadru Yamuna Gomati and forest tracts --- Bharata passes Torana Jambu Varutha and Salavana --- Bharata sights Manu-built Ayodhya after seven nights --- City looks dusty unfamiliar without tumult --- Gardens stand empty like weeping forest --- No vehicles elephants or horses move forth --- People appear pale tearful emaciated and longing --- Bharata enters Vaijayanta gate toward grieving palace
